  "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</span><img border=\"0\" src=\"/assets/images/content/418f56abc640a0f997.png\" style=\"text-align: center;\" /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><h2><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\">🕯️ מעט מן האור</span></h2><p style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בַּחֲלוֹמוֹתַיי,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שָׁבוֹת מַעֲלִיּוֹת.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">קוֹמוֹת דּוֹלְגוֹת.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">גַּגּוֹת פּוֹרְצוֹת.</span></p><p style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בִּתְנוּמַת עַפְעַפַּיי,<br />בִּמְאֻזַּן נָעוֹת.<br />חֲסֵרוֹת דְּלָתוֹת.<br />כַּבָּרָק מְהִירוֹת.</span></p><p style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בְּחֶזְיוֹנוֹתַיי, <br />לַלַּחְצָנִים - אֵין הַיָּד מַגַּעַת.<br />וְהַמַּעֲלִית - מֵאֵלֶיהָ נוֹסַעַת.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְלִי - אֵין דֶּרֶךְ לָדַעַת...</span></p></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">📘 עצה שבועית</span></h2><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\">אַל תְּפָרֵשׁ כָּל חֲלוֹם כִּבְשׂוֹרָה,</div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\">וְאַל תִּבָּהֵל מֵחֲלוֹם כְּהַתְרָעָה.</div><p data-end=\"255\" data-start=\"153\">רַק הַתְבּוֹנֵן - מַה הוּא מְלַמֵּד עָלֶיךָ.</p></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">🌀 הצד השני של המטבע</span></h2><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מִי שֶׁאֵינוֹ חוֹלֵם - לֹא יוֹדֵעַ מָה הוּא חָסֵר.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מִי שֶׁחוֹלֵם - בַּדֶּרֶךְ לְמַלֵּא חֶסְרוֹנוֹ.</span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div></span><div><span><span><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">💎 פנינה</span></h2></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"וַיַּחֲלֹם יוֹסֵף חֲלוֹם\" = 334 = נרדף (<i>וַיַּגֵּד לְאֶחָיו וַיּוֹסִפוּ עוֹד שְׂנֹא אֹתוֹ</i>)</span><p><br /></p></div><div><span><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">📘 מילון ארמי־עברי</span></h2><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #626262; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">חמש מילים מארמית שבתורה - עם פענוח והארה לשונית.</i></span></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #626262; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p><p><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-family: arial; text-align: -webkit-center;\"></span></p></span><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'<b>מְאַלְּמִים אֲלֻמִּים</b>' / '<b>מְאַסְּרִין אֲסָרָן</b>'<br /></span><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">❖ אוגדים אגדים, קושרים קשרים - אוסרים איסרים</span></span>.</span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'<b>נִצָּבָה</b>' / '<b>אִזְדְּקֵיפַת</b>'</span><br /><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">❖</span></span>&nbsp;קמה, נעמדה - הזדקפה.</span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'<b>וְהַיָּרֵחַ</b>' / '<b>וְסֵיהֲרָא</b>'<br /></span><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">❖</span></span>&nbsp;ירח - סהר.</span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'<b>וַיִּגְעַר</b>' / '<b>וּנְזַף</b>'<br /></span><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">❖</span></span>&nbsp;גערה - נזיפה</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">.</span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'<b>בֶּצַע</b>' / '<b>מָמוֹן</b>'<br /></span><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">❖</span></span>&nbsp;רווח כספי - ממוני.</span></span></span></li></ol><span><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">👁️ מבט חד<br /></h2></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/77f363470b075e5347.png\" style=\"clear: right; float: right; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"מסך וואטסאפ עם קבוצת &quot;האחים&quot;. יוסף מנסה לספר את החלום אבל האחים עוזבים וחוסמים\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"530\" data-original-width=\"359\" height=\"320\" src=\"/assets/images/content/77f363470b075e5347.png\" width=\"217\" /></a></div><br /></div>"
}
